      "text": "Traditional Finnish midsummer sports for the NES. Four of Finland's finest athletes compete in a midsummer triathlon consisting of:\r\n\r\n    Beer run\r\n    Beer rowing\r\n    Rowboat urination\r\n\r\nThe games push our athletes to the edge physically and mentally as they compete to win the ultimate midsummer triathlon. Who will be the last one to stay above water?"
